{"4599600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gambling Simulator", "steam_appid": 4599600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599600/extras/c84f3992ad3573a02be26d00b47e685b.avif?t=1779575900\" width=1280 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to decide your fate with a single flip? In <strong>Flip The Coin</strong>, you start with nothing but a simple penny. What begins as a simple click evolves into a deep strategic challenge where every decision shapes your wealth. It’s all about money!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Clicking Experience:</strong> Accumulate coins through rapid clicks. Every flip brings you closer to the next milestone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System:</strong> Invest your hard-earned coins in upgrades. Maximize your profit per click or automate your income and watch your balance skyrocket while you relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Steam Cloud Integration:</strong> Your progress is safe. Thanks to full Steam synchronization, you can pick up exactly where you left off, anytime and anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Rags to Riches:</strong> Experience the ultimate satisfaction as cents turn into billions. Do you have what it takes to become the world’s greatest Coin Tycoon?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Flip The Coin?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game blends the addictive mechanics of classic idle games with a modern, clean design. Whether you’re playing for five minutes or strategizing for hours, <strong>Flip The Coin</strong> delivers the perfect flow for every type of player.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"b